  "title": "Mungo Park's first Niger expedition",
  "summary": "The African Association hired the Scottish surgeon Mungo Park in 1795 to locate the Niger. He left Pisania on the Gambia on 2 December 1795, saw the river at Segou in July 1796 and reached Silla on 29 July, where he turned back. He arrived at Falmouth on 22 December 1797.",
  "when": {
