      "year": 1795
    },
    "end": {
      "year": 1797
    },
    "precision": "month",
    "uncertainty": {
      "note": "Gale says Park left Britain in May 1795; Thomson (1890) gives departure from Pisania on 2 December 1795, the night of 20 July 1796 in a village before the Niger, Silla on 29 July 1796 and Falmouth on 22 December 1797. End year 1797 is the Falmouth arrival; Gale says \"late 1797\"."
    },
