  "reviewer_note": "Least sure: place names. I could place only Segou; Pisania and Silla have no modern location on the pages I opened, so there is no path (the task note asked for one). Gale text gives conflicting distances (over 200 miles vs over 1,000 miles up the Niger), so none is used. Dates come from a secondary biography (Thomson 1890), not Park's own journal.",
